1737cf72cc36END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_WYR_CampestriTales</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_CampestriTales\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_CampestriTales\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">c524d1d5-757e-43ab-9fa2-ec04507161fe</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c524d1d5-757e-43ab-9fa2-ec04507161fe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c524d1d5-757e-43ab-9fa2-ec04507161fe\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a table in the <a href=\"/wiki/Requisitioned_Barn\" title=\"Requisitioned Barn\">Requisitioned Barn</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;77&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-110</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[An excerpt from a book of short, but terribly outdated tales for children, told by Mother Campestri.]\n</p><p>The Hungry Bullywug. Once, there lived a Bullywug whose name was Billy. His clothes were ragged, he never washed, and he spoke in tongues that nobody could ever understand. But the worst thing about Billy was that he was always hungry. First he ate all the food that was in his village, then he moved on to villages nearby. Soon, the entire region was starving because Billy could never have enough. Villagers offered to teach Billy how to farm, but Billy was lazy. Billy only ever wanted to live off the kindness of others. So that is what he did. One day, the villagers decided they'd had enough. They had been forced to live off their supplies for months, and were sick of it. And Billy, having gotten fat from eating all of their food, had started to look rather appetising himself.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714204557\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1350/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27196/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8423/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931284/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.833      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   40.833      1 -total\n 48.36%   19.748      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.04%   17.576     15 Template:Trim\n 23.48%    9.587      2 Template:Uid\n 17.77%    7.256      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.56%    5.539      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.94%    4.060      1 Template:Books\n  9.32%    3.807      6 Template:Ifempty\n  9.26%    3.783      1 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Save